{"page":1,"results":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":109293,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Corneliu Porumboiu","original_name":"Corneliu Porumboiu","popularity":0.2562,"profile_path":"/pnyj6CQcMg81EI15XEGFb3Qy0Ge.jpg","known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/s3X7UVfnmycegqfkWSp4oEplJbn.jpg","id":504582,"title":"The Whistlers","original_title":"La Gomera","overview":"A Romanian police officer, determined to free from prison a crooked businessman who knows where a mobster's money is hidden, must learn the difficult ancestral whistling language (Silbo Gomero) used on the island of Gomera.","poster_path":"/osVaEZasM0LH6l5OPflFIT4G1H8.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"ro","genre_ids":[53,80],"popularity":2.6122,"release_date":"2019-09-13","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.967,"vote_count":182},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/ttTmzzIeaOvYWouvg3iWJHEldF4.jpg","id":24159,"title":"12:08 East of Bucharest","original_title":"A fost sau n-a fost?","overview":"It's the 22nd of December. Sixteen years have passed since the revolution, and in a small town Christmas is about to come. Piscoci, an old retired man is preparing for another Christmas alone. Manescu, the history teacher, tries to keep up with his debts. Jderescu, the owner of a local television post, seems not to be so interested in the upcoming holidays. For him, the time to face history has come. Along with Manescu and Piscoci, he is trying to answer for himself a question which for 16 years has not had an answer: \"Was it or wasn't it a revolution in their town?\"","poster_path":"/a7bBUXKWzhtqaPDyksOebSHeD6N.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"ro","genre_ids":[35,18],"popularity":1.0199,"release_date":"2006-09-29","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.903,"vote_count":124},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/tmsfABTLoVmSIrieQ61haVu7J1t.jpg","id":334924,"title":"The Treasure","original_title":"Comoara","overview":"Costi is a family man whose cash-strapped ne